# Server URL the app auto-connects to on first launch (or after the store
# is cleared) -- most deployments have exactly one server, so this saves
# every install from typing in a URL it's overwhelmingly likely to already
# know. The app still always lets you view/change the configured URL
# afterward ("Change server URL", R4/AE2) -- this only skips the *first*
# manual entry, not the ability to point at a different server later.
# Build-time only, same as frontend's VITE_* vars -- baked in at
# `npm run build`, not read at runtime.
VITE_DEFAULT_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:8080
